<title>USA: Bridger Wyo. 500 MW power unit seen up late Thurs.</title>
<headline>Bridger Wyo. 500 MW power unit seen up late Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 500 megawatt (MW) unit 1 at the Jim Bridger coal-fired power plant in Wyoming is expected to restart late Thursday evening, sources familiar with the unit's operations said early Thursday.</p>
<p>The unit was reportedly shut Wednesday because of a boiler tube leak.</p>
<p>PacifiCorp is the majority owner and operator of the Bridger plant.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
